                <mxCell id="14" value="&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Creating event queue on first view of the task&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Send first event to related agent&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Receive response as separate event from agent&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Rethink the queue&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Loop:&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Send followed event to the related agent&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Receive response as separate event from agent&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Rethink the queue&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;When courier means, this are enought data:&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Send to sages&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Receive response from sages&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;If REVOCED, rethink queue and restart loop&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;If APPROVED continue&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Send task_id to Tinker&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Wait for response from Observer&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Send final event with all information to Librarian&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
